Expected Time Complexity: O(log(N))
Expected Space Complexity: O(1)
Constraints:
1 <= N <= 10^{18} #User function Template for python3
class Solution:
	def is_power_of_eight(self, n):
		# Code here\nUse Call-Based format
[code] def is_power_of_eight(n):
    if n == 1:
        return "Yes"
    while n % 8 == 0 and n > 1:
        n //= 8
    if n == 1:
        return "Yes"
    return "No"
